+Test fixture, **do not publish**. The content originated in the `/tmp/demo-plugin` of the historical
+validation environment (legacy style written against the real interface of
+`@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-apiproxy@0.0.1-rc.1`); the only additions were `"private": true` in
